}6 & -1 \\\\ -9 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =19(-2+20)+2(12-36)-4(30-9) \\\\  & =342-48-84 \\\\  & =210.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{{D}_{y}}{D}=\\frac{210}{2k+20}.\n$$\n\nFrom the problem statement, we know that $y=21.$ So, we can solve for $k$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{210}{2k+20} & =21 \\\\ 10 & =2k+20 \\\\ 2k & =-10 \\\\ k & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346476 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346477 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346478 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346479 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346480 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1041 "selection" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346476 13194139535374 true] [17592186346475 1110 #uuid "5c6457dd-d587-5b7e-a231-e7ae3d70e65b" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346476 1034 "k=-5" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346476 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535374 true] [17592186346476 1111 #uuid "230825ff-d4ff-523f-a523-da9e0ecf4ce8" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346477 1034 "k=3" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346477 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535374 true] [17592186346477 1111 #uuid "3a25fc17-b3f3-5c86-a7ae-4b27e0b77a36" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346478 1034 "k=-2" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346478 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535374 true] [17592186346478 1111 #uuid "1781ae4f-3c4c-5ca3-a32a-5b2bbf093035" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346479 1034 "k=4" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346479 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535374 true] [17592186346479 1111 #uuid "7fcd42be-ed89-5a5c-a518-f4ed98d600a8" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346480 1034 "k=-6" 13194139535374 true] [17592186346480 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535374 true] [17592186346480 1111 #uuid "094ada10-82d7-5c9f-8e86-4faa7